'''Laboratory of Relics''' (古代研究所 ''Kodai Kenkyūjo'', '''Ancient Laboratory''') is the 49th and final sub-chapter in [[Stories of Legend]]. After completing the only level in this sub-chapter, the player is rewarded with [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha-Bun]] and will be able to unlock the [[True Form]]s of other [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]]. Until all other Stories of Legend sub-chapters are cleared on 4-Crown difficulty, it will only be available up to 3-Crown.

Once completed on all Crown difficulties, the only stage in the 4-Crown version of this sub-chapter will be [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|invaded]] by [[Idi:Re]]. On clear, the stage returns to its normal state.

==Difficulty==
The only stage here can be deadly without proper [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]]. The boss and peons can shred the player's defenses and obliterate any heavy-hitting cats. Refer to the [[Eldritch Forces|stage's article]] for more in-depth explanations. The invaded version of the stage is exponentially harder with the restrictions, practically requiring [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] and a level 40+ [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]].
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]]: A mechanical variant of [[Teacher Bun Bun]]. It is quite similar, but has higher HP, damage, attack rate and Omni Strike extending its reach. Despite having the word "Mecha" in its name, it is not a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy, and keeps the [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] trait.
*[[Idi:Re]]: A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy encountered in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]]. She has short range, piercing Omni Strikes and massive health, attack power and speed, but is fairly easy to stall because of her long backswing, unless the peons get in the way.
[[Relic Doge]], a powerful Relic variant of [[Doge]] first introduced in [[A New Legend|next sub-chapter]], can also be seen in the Eldritch Forces Invasion.

This sub-chapter also features two drop units [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha-Bun]] and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]], both unlocked at 100% chance upon clearing their respective stages.

