==Trivia==
*With the exception of [[Zero Luza]], all [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus Enemies]]' Japanese descriptions state that they were created in the Laboratory of Relics via genome editing.
*With only 1 stage, Laboratory of Relics is the shortest sub-chapter in Stories of Legend.
*Unlike other sub-chapters, its name will not be visible until [[The Legend Ends|the one preceding it]] has already been completed. This is presumably because it is meant to come as a surprise.
*This is the only Stories of Legend sub-chapter to contain [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemies]] and drop [[Ototo Corps|Ammonites]], albeit only in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Invasion]].

